    "changelog": "## What's Changed\r\n- Fix frustumculling not using whitelist, Fix frustum-culling using the uninflated hitbox. Fix [#341](https://github.com/tr7zw/EntityCulling/issues/341). This should fix any weird pop-in/outs happening when just turning the camera\r\n- Make the entity reference weak to prevent leaks caused by Fabric API. Fix [#6](https://github.com/tr7zw/TRansition/issues/6) . Over multiple corners, TRansition(one of my libs) with FabricAPI caused a leak of the entire level when leaving a world, wasting memory. \r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tr7zw/EntityCulling/compare/1.11.2...1.11.3\n",
